WEBVTT

00:04:00.695 --> 00:04:02.029
How do I know?

00:04:02.488 --> 00:04:03.656
For seven years,

00:04:03.698 --> 00:04:08.411
I've been studying a set of 650 bedrooms
twerking videos by Black girls.

00:04:08.452 --> 00:04:12.957
They were uploaded to YouTube
between 2006 and 2014.

00:04:13.541 --> 00:04:16.752
Over 1,000 girls from all around the world

00:04:16.752 --> 00:04:19.213
selected 200 twerk songs

00:04:19.255 --> 00:04:21.549
and only nine voices of women,

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:25.386
including Nicki Minaj, Beyoncé, Ciara

00:04:25.386 --> 00:04:28.806
and one indie artist
named Katie Got Bandz.

00:04:29.557 --> 00:04:31.350
So what's behind all this?